ur shop running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/908c18730590322c55f04b44f0f4ba3c.poster.avif?t=1773293220\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/908c18730590322c55f04b44f0f4ba3c.webm?t=1773293220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your kitchen, attract more customers, and boost productivity to stay ahead of the ever-increasing rent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/78a5d06c45286e56f1448ef7cfc34f16.poster.avif?t=1773293220\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/78a5d06c45286e56f1448ef7cfc34f16.webm?t=1773293220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Against Time \u2013 With limited daily actions, you must balance exploration, baking, and shopkeeping before the next rent deadline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/f396f404d4d9f7d491d4f362f0350b94.poster.avif?t=1773293220\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extr